[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678272336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-3678272336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":3678272336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7bPftQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-21T00:46:08Z","updated_at":"2025-12-21T00:46:08Z","body":"> - [ ] Should Image::decompress on these new formats automatically convert to linear color? That would keep the previous behavior for how these files were handled, but would be lossy (in that converting between sRGB and linear with integers isn't 1:1).\r\n\r\nI would preserve existing behavior by default, but add an optional `preserve_srgb` parameter that defaults to `false`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3678272336/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691651932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-3691651932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":3691651932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cCiNc","user":{"login":"BenLubar","id":4257305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4257305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar","html_url":"https://github.com/BenLubar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-25T18:18:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-25T19:06:30Z","body":"Okay, problem: `FORMAT_DXT5` (for example) is *currently* sent to the GPU as linear and then converted from sRGB to linear in the shader. (at least according to the Image::Format enum documentation.)\r\n\r\nI'm currently trying to figure out where exactly that's actually happening, because it's making all *actual* sRGB textures get converted to linear twice, making them much darker than they should be.\r\n\r\n**Edit:** Found it:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/drivers/gles3/shaders/scene.glsl#L2188-L2190\r\n\r\nThis is *after* the code has already multiplied values together which is incorrect to do with non-linear color spaces.\r\n\r\nWhich means that currently, *all* image formats are treated as sRGB despite being sent to the GPU as non-sRGB. Not sure how to fix this without breaking backwards compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691651932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691695446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-3691695446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":3691695446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cCs1W","user":{"login":"BenLubar","id":4257305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4257305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar","html_url":"https://github.com/BenLubar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-25T19:38:06Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T19:44:29Z","body":"<img width=\"1107\" height=\"526\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4737d95a-8694-40a7-89a4-c6fc83fa383d\" />\r\n<img width=\"1070\" height=\"552\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/501172e1-8e1c-487e-9aa7-9545db4547ea\" />\r\n<img width=\"1145\" height=\"527\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/943eea64-78ed-48de-84b6-d688a517e13e\" />\r\n\r\nThe 2D view (for example, previewing the texture in the editor) looks the same as gl_compatibility for all three renderers.\r\n\r\nHere's my test texture:\r\n[card_back_attacker.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24340220/card_back_attacker.zip)\r\n\r\nAssuming I didn't create the ktx2 files wrong, all four of the sprites should look identical.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3691695446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"outdated"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693230579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-3693230579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":3693230579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cIjnz","user":{"login":"BenLubar","id":4257305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTczMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4257305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar","html_url":"https://github.com/BenLubar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenLubar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T18:46:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T18:46:46Z","body":"Getting rid of most of what I did because it looks like having Godot care whether a texture is sRGB or linear is going to cause a lot of changes to Godot internals.\r\n\r\nRight now, from what I can tell, Godot sends every texture to the GPU as linear and then converts the ones it thinks are sRGB (albedo, for example) to actual linear in the shader.\r\n\r\nAssuming that textures that *should* have color information are encoded as sRGB and textures that should not have color information are encoded as linear, Godot already does the \"right thing\" for textures that would be imported from ktx2 files; it just needs to be willing to import them, which is the only thing this PR now does.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693230579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122665997","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-4122665997","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":4122665997,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc71uuQN","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T02:16:48Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T02:16:48Z","body":"I asked @allenwp for another pair of eyes","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4122665997/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4128597670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-4128597670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":4128597670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc72FWam","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T17:55:35Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T17:55:35Z","body":"I've taken a look and it seems this is outside of my wheelhouse (colour science) and primarily about file formats and graphics API stuff. The comments that have been added make sense to me, but I don't think I can add anything else to this one with my current knowledge. Thanks for the ping!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4128597670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6203717069","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114125#issuecomment-6203717069","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114125","id":6203717069,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABccU1zQ","user":{"login":"dcvz","id":2475932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzU5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2475932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz","html_url":"https://github.com/dcvz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-15T22:37:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T22:37:45Z","body":"I tried this rebased on master (d824ca9fe2; the only conflicts were the new 6x6 cases and the `pixel_rshift` → `get_format_pixels_shifted()` change), with a handful of small KTX1 and KTX2 files:\n\n```\n                                 master          this PR\nktx1_RGB8_ETC2.ktx               ETC2_RGB8       ETC2_RGB8\nktx1_RGBA_ASTC_4x4.ktx           ASTC_4x4_HDR    ASTC_4x4_HDR\nktx1_RGB_S3TC_DXT1.ktx           DXT1            DXT1\nktx1_SRGB8_ALPHA8_ASTC_4x4.ktx   ASTC_4x4        ASTC_4x4\nktx1_SRGB8_ETC2.ktx              load failed     load failed\nktx1_SRGB_S3TC_DXT1.ktx          load failed     DXT1\nktx2_ASTC_4x4_SRGB.ktx2          ASTC_4x4        ASTC_4x4\nktx2_ASTC_4x4_UNORM.ktx2         ASTC_4x4_HDR    ASTC_4x4\nktx2_BC1_RGB_SRGB.ktx2           load failed     DXT1\nktx2_BC1_RGB_UNORM.ktx2          DXT1            DXT1\nktx2_ETC2_RGB8_SRGB.ktx2         load failed     ETC2_RGB8\nktx2_ETC2_RGB8_UNORM.ktx2        ETC2_RGB8       ETC2_RGB8\n```\n\nThe KTX2 cases above all load as the right format now. What's still off:\n\n- `GL_COMPRESSED_RGBA_ASTC_4x4_KHR` in KTX1 still loads as HDR. The new check looks at `glType == GL_UNSIGNED_BYTE`, but the KTX 1 spec has `glType` and `glFormat` at 0 for compressed formats, so a conforming file never takes that branch. Same check for 8x8. That GL enum covers both LDR and HDR ASTC, so the header can't tell them apart either way; it's more a question of which one to assume.\n- `GL_COMPRESSED_SRGB8_ETC2` (0x9275) isn't mapped, so that one still fails. The switch doesn't have `GL_COMPRESSED_SRGB8_ALPHA8_ETC2_EAC` either but I didn't test a file for it.\n- The 6x6 cases from #115003 need the same UNORM/SFLOAT split after the rebase and  `VK_FORMAT_ASTC_6x6_UNORM_BLOCK` still maps to HDR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6203717069/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]